    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427610/extras/a9073bc86040b5a1aaa42bb74bb12660.poster.avif?t=1740491136\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427610/extras/a9073bc86040b5a1aaa42bb74bb12660.webm?t=1740491136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427610/extras/a9073bc86040b5a1aaa42bb74bb12660.mp4?t=1740491136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Brace yourself for an epic challenge as you juggle the art of cooking, the thrill of reckless driving, and the pressure of timely deliveries through bite-sized levels that are sure to get your adrenaline pumping! Jump behind the wheel, fire up the blender, and let the chaos begin!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427610/extras/6a4159748511f4a328c602921bb19086.poster.avif?t=1740491136\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427610/extras/6a4159748511f4a328c602921bb19086.webm?t=1740491136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427610/extras/6a4159748511f4a328c602921bb19086.mp4?t=1740491136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Feel the rush of adrenaline as you zip through busy roads and race against the clock to make those urgent deliveries.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427610/extras/f2cb1812ae869c90b006f1668cf296ca.poster.avif?t=1740491136\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427610/extras/f2cb1812ae869c90b006f1668cf296ca.webm?t=1740491136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427610/extras/f2cb1812ae869c90b006f1668cf296ca.mp4?t=1740491136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Take charge of your kitchen, expertly blending mouthwatering smoothies with speed and finesse; then lob them to thirsty customers at breakneck speeds from your sunroof!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427610/extras/577c9b31a9bb0be230f0d1ca099784c3.poster.avif?t=1740491136\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427610/extras/577c9b31a9bb0be230f0d1ca099784c3.webm?t=1740491136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427610/extras/577c9b31a9bb0be230f0d1ca099784c3.mp4?t=1740491136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Journey along scenic highway Fruit 66, chasing down wacky customers, wackier obstacles, and the ever-elusive five-star rating!",
